<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DRESSER INDUSTRIES STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DRESSER INDUSTRIES STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said it initiated coverage of Dresser Industries Inc with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- said set a fiscal 1997 earnings estimate of $1.70 a share and operating cash flow estimates of $3.19 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects 1997 consolidated revenue of $7.4 billion and EBITDA of $787 million.</p>
<p>-- for fiscal 1998, set an earnings estimate of $2.24 a share and operating cash flow estimate of $3.79 a share.</p>
<p>-- Dresser closed Tuesday at 39-10/16.</p>
</text>
